    <tags>osu osu-mania etterna stepmania beatmap converter vsrg rhythm-game</tags>
    <summary>Convert osu!mania maps and skins to and from Etterna and StepMania.</summary>
    <description>Henkan is a cross-platform desktop and CLI tool for converting maps and skins between osu!mania and Etterna or StepMania while preserving timing, BPM changes, holds, metadata, and snapping.</description>
